--- plymouth.changes.orig
+++ plymouth.changes
@@ -1,3 +1,19 @@
+-------------------------------------------------------------------
+Sun Nov 01 07:09:12 UTC 2026 - h0cheung <hcheunh@gmail.com>
+
+- Update to 26.134.222 for native evdev/XKB input and configurable Escape
+  alternatives on devices without a keyboard.
+- Switch to Meson while retaining the official RPM library/theme split and
+  systemd integration. Add libevdev, xkbcommon and XKB data dependencies.
+- Retain openSUSE dracut paths, colors, service lifetime, quiet initrd and
+  keyboard handler patches. Drop the superseded font/hotplug/manpage patches,
+  the old Autotools logo change, legacy DPI heuristic and SLE VMware patch.
+- Use upstream boot logging and opt-in Plymouth debug tracing.
+- Export xkbcommon include flags for public input headers and update the
+  installed file list for Meson and the new release archive.
+- Rebase openSUSE WatermarkPath support; add an opt-in internal-panel boot
+  orientation override without changing desktop DRM orientation properties.
+
 -------------------------------------------------------------------
 Tue Feb 10 15:29:57 UTC 2026 - Cliff Zhao <qzhao@suse.com>
 
